SUNSET KEYS — Port Alba: a sun-soaked open-world crime game in the browser. Explore the coastal city of Port Alba on foot and by car, steal cars, dodge the Port Alba PD, climb the wanted ladder, and run the Sunset Keys story — seven missions from the marina to the lighthouse — plus taxi fares, stunt jumps, and hidden keys. Top-down 2D, keyboard and mouse, no build step, no network: every script, sound, and pixel is generated by the game's own code.

## Run it

```sh
node serve.ts
```

Then open http://localhost:8080 and play. WASD or arrows to move and drive, E to enter or exit a car, Space to handbrake, Shift to sprint, F to punch, H to honk, M to mute, P or Esc to pause.

